  "text": "### Incident Reporting  \n**Immediate Actions:**\n- Report to manager immediately\n- Record in incident log\n- Escalate to Risk team if >£10k loss\n- Escalate to Compliance if regulatory breach  \n**Information Captured:**\n- Date, time, incident type\n- Affected systems/processes\n- Estimated impact\n- Root cause (if known)\n- Immediate containment steps",
  "name": "Chunk 19/32",
  "_domain": "banking.policy",
  "prev_chunk_id": "01a0731c-a88f-7475-a431-ceac321bee08_018",
  "next_chunk_id": "01a0731c-a88f-7475-a431-ceac321bee08_020",
